    "https://csusystem.wd12.myworkdayjobs.com/fortcollins_careers/job/Fort-Collins-CO/Adjunct-Instructor---FWCB_R2026102436": {
      "title": "Adjunct Instructor - FWCB (Evergreen)",
      "description": "Posted: 2026-09-17\nFull time\n\nJob Description Job Description: Adjunct teaching assignment to teach classes in the Department of Fish, Wildlife, and Conservation Biology. Job Responsibilities: Teaching undergraduate courses. Conditions of employment: Pre-employment Criminal Background Check (Required for new employees). Must be legally authorized to work in the U.S. CSU will not sponsor visa. Required Job Qualifications: PhD in conservation social sciences or human dimensions of natural resources. Preferred Job Qualifications: Theoretical expertise in one or more social science disciplines. Experience teaching or assisting in undergraduate courses. Salary Range: $8,000 - $15,000 per semester. Application Instructions: To apply, please upload a resume and cover letter. This is an evergreen posting. Applications will be reviewed as hiring needs arise, and qualified applicants may be contacted by individual faculty members if a suitable opportunity becomes available. This pool will expire on December 31, 2026. Applicants wishing to be considered beyond this date must reapply. Please note, applicants may redact information from their application materials that identifies their age, date of birth, or dates of attendance at or graduation from an educational institution. Employee Benefits Colorado State University is not just a workplace; it’s a thriving community that’s transforming lives and improving the human condition through world-class teaching, research, and service. With a robust benefits package, collaborative atmosphere, and focus on work-life balance, CSU is where you can thrive, grow, and make a lasting impact. Review our detailed benefits information here. Explore the additional perks of working at CSU here. For the total value of CSU benefits in addition to wages, use our compensation calculator. Lastly, click here for more information about why Fort Collins is consistently ranked in the top cities to live in! Background Check Policy